                     }
                 }
             }
         }
     }
     ```

6. **Testing and Debugging:**
   - Test your app on different devices and simulators to ensure it works as expected.
   - Use Xcode’s debugging tools to identify and fix any issues.

This is a basic introduction to creating a Swift UI app. SwiftUI is a powerful framework that allows you to create beautiful and interactive user interfaces with a simple and intuitive syntax. As you become more familiar with SwiftUI, you can explore more advanced features and techniques to build more complex and feature-rich applications.

